  "description": "Bruce Jenner is the former name of Caitlyn Jenner, a well-known American Olympic gold medalist and television personality who publicly transitioned to becoming a woman in 2015. The meme references his transition by implying he was once 'Frankenstein's monster,' using a grotesque horror metaphor to mock his identity and transition. This requires knowledge of his public identity and transition to understand the meme's intent.",
